        {
          "text": "Lino Abramu wakainka, mbubonya mbuli Jehova mbwaakamwaambila. Alakwe Loti wakainka awe. Nkabela Abramu kajisi myaka iili makumi aali musanu aabili amyaka yosanwe naakazwa ku-Harani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
