                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Abramu wakatolelela Sarai banakwe, a-Loti mwana wamwanike wakwe, ambono zyabo zyoonse nzibakavubide, abasiŋanda boonse mbobakajene ku-Harani, Bakainka kuya kunyika ya-Kanana, nkabela bakasika nkukonya oko kunyika ya-Kanana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
